50380:The crfD field can be omitted if the result of the comparison is to be placed into the CR0 field. Otherwise, the target CR field must be specified as the first operand. One of the CR field symbols defined in Section E.1 Symbols can be used for this operand.
50381:Note: The crfD field can normally be omitted when the CR0 field is the target, if L is specified the assembler requires that crfD be specified explicitly.
