12331: 1Key to Mode Dependency Column
12332: 
12333: Except as described below and in Section 1.12.2,
12334: "Effective Address Calculation" on page 14, all
12335: instructions are independent of whether the processor
12336: is in 32-bit or 64-bit mode.
12337: 
12338: CT    If the instruction tests the Count Register, it       32      The instruction must be executed only in
12339:                                                                     32-bit mode.
12340:       tests the low-order 32 bits in 32-bit mode and
12341:                                                                     The instruction must be executed only in
12342:       all 64 bits in 64-bit mode.                           64      64-bit mode.
12343: 
12344: SR    The setting of status registers (such as XER
12345: 
