Book I defines the word rotate as a 64-bit value containing two copies of the rotated low word. Its mask rules therefore support B’s wrapping update. I also found additional PEM errors in the programming notes: they name the wrong source or destination half. I’m checking all mask combinations and the CR0 width rule next.

