8861: 2. Insert the bit extracted in (1) into the sign bit (bit 0) of register Rz.
8862: 
8863: insrdi Rz,Rx,1,0                                   (equivalent to:             rldimi Rz,Rx,63,0)
8864: 
8865: 3. Shift the contents of register Rx left 8 bits.
8866: 
8867: sldi Rx,Rx,8                                       (equivalent to:             rldicr Rx,Rx,8,55)
8868: 
8869: 4. Clear the high-order 32 bits of register Ry and place the result into register Rx.
8870: 
8871: clrldi Rx,Ry,32                                    (equivalent to:             rldicl Rx,Ry,0,32)
